{"seq":2,"slug":"llamaindex","title":"LlamaIndex 索引框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/frameworks/llamaindex","wordCount":902,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"llamaindex-索引框架\">LlamaIndex 索引框架</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LlamaIndex 的定位可以一句话概括：<strong>让 LLM 用上你的私有数据</strong>。它与 LangChain 的分工不是竞争而是侧重不同——LangChain 关心「如何编排流程」，LlamaIndex 关心「如何把数据组织成能被高效检索和利用的形态」。「索引」正是这一侧重的核心隐喻。</p>\n<p>理解 LlamaIndex 要抓住三个层层递进的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>索引（Index）是数据的组织形态。</strong> 同样是你的文档，切成怎样的块、以什么结构存放（向量、树、摘要、图），直接决定了后续能回答什么类型的问题。选索引，本质是选「未来的查询方式」。</li>\n<li><strong>查询引擎（Query Engine）是「检索 + 合成」的封装。</strong> 它把「取回相关片段」和「用 LLM 把片段合成答案」两步合为一个接口，并允许你选择合成的策略（逐段 refine、树状总结等）。不同的合成策略在质量、成本和适用场景上各有取舍。</li>\n<li><strong>Agent 是查询能力的工具化。</strong> 当查询引擎被封装成一个工具交给 Agent 调用，检索就从「固定流程」变成了「按需决策」——Agent 自己判断该查什么、查几次，从而支持多步、数据感知的推理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者是「表示 → 存取 → 应用」的递进关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表示</td>\n<td>索引类型</td>\n<td>数据以什么结构存放？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存取</td>\n<td>查询引擎</td>\n<td>如何检索并合成答案？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用</td>\n<td>Agent</td>\n<td>何时、如何调用检索？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[&quot;数据源&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;Data Connectors&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;Index&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; QE[&quot;Query Engine&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; AG[&quot;Agent&quot;]&#10;    QE --&gt; R[&quot;查询结果&quot;]&#10;    AG --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    D[\"数据源\"] --&gt; C[\"Data Connectors\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"Index\"]\n    I --&gt; QE[\"Query Engine\"]\n    I --&gt; AG[\"Agent\"]\n    QE --&gt; R[\"查询结果\"]\n    AG --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"llamaindex-定位与核心理念\">LlamaIndex 定位与核心理念</h2><p>LlamaIndex 专注于<strong>数据驱动的 LLM 应用</strong>，核心理念是帮助开发者高效地将私有数据与 LLM 连接起来。与 LangChain 侧重于通用编排不同，LlamaIndex 在数据索引、检索和查询方面有更深入的抽象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[&quot;数据源&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;Data Connectors&lt;br/&gt;数据连接器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;Index&lt;br/&gt;索引&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; QE[&quot;Query Engine&lt;br/&gt;查询引擎&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; CE[&quot;Chat Engine&lt;br/&gt;对话引擎&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; AG[&quot;Agent&lt;br/&gt;智能体&quot;]&#10;    QE --&gt; R[&quot;查询结果&quot;]&#10;    CE --&gt; R&#10;    AG --&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n    D[\"数据源\"] --&gt; C[\"Data Connectors&lt;br/&gt;数据连接器\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"Index&lt;br/&gt;索引\"]\n    I --&gt; QE[\"Query Engine&lt;br/&gt;查询引擎\"]\n    I --&gt; CE[\"Chat Engine&lt;br/&gt;对话引擎\"]\n    I --&gt; AG[\"Agent&lt;br/&gt;智能体\"]\n    QE --&gt; R[\"查询结果\"]\n    CE --&gt; R\n    AG --&gt; R</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引类型\">索引类型</h2><p>LlamaIndex 提供了多种索引类型，针对不同的数据结构和查询需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>查询方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VectorStoreIndex</td>\n<td>向量嵌入+相似性搜索</td>\n<td>语义搜索</td>\n<td>自然语言查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SummaryIndex</td>\n<td>每个文档生成摘要</td>\n<td>全文档总结</td>\n<td>摘要聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TreeIndex</td>\n<td>层级树状结构</td>\n<td>长文档查询</td>\n<td>逐层筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KeywordTableIndex</td>\n<td>关键词映射</td>\n<td>关键词搜索</td>\n<td>关键词匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KnowledgeGraphIndex</td>\n<td>知识图谱</td>\n<td>关系推理</td>\n<td>图遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from llama_index.core import VectorStoreIndex, SimpleDirectoryReader, Settings&#10;from llama_index.llms.openai import OpenAI&#10;from llama_index.embeddings.openai import OpenAIEmbedding&#10;&#10;Settings.llm = OpenAI(model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;)&#10;Settings.embed_model = OpenAIEmbedding(model=&quot;text-embedding-3-small&quot;)&#10;&#10;documents = SimpleDirectoryReader(&quot;./data&quot;).load_data()&#10;index = VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents)&#10;&#10;query_engine = index.as_query_engine(similarity_top_k=5)&#10;response = query_engine.query(&quot;这个项目的主要架构是什么？&quot;)&#10;print(response)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.core </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VectorStoreIndex, SimpleDirectoryReader, Settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.llms.openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.embeddings.openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIEmbedding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Settings.llm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Settings.embed_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAIEmbedding(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text-embedding-3-small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">documents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SimpleDirectoryReader(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).load_data()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query_engine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index.as_query_engine(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">similarity_top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_engine.query(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"这个项目的主要架构是什么？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"查询引擎\">查询引擎</h2><p>查询引擎（Query Engine）是 LlamaIndex 的核心抽象之一，将检索和生成整合为一步操作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Q[&quot;用户查询&quot;] --&gt; R[&quot;Retriever&lt;br/&gt;检索器&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; N[&quot;Nodes&lt;br/&gt;相关文档片段&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; S[&quot;Response Synthesizer&lt;br/&gt;响应合成器&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; A[&quot;最终回答&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Q[\"用户查询\"] --&gt; R[\"Retriever&lt;br/&gt;检索器\"]\n    R --&gt; N[\"Nodes&lt;br/&gt;相关文档片段\"]\n    N --&gt; S[\"Response Synthesizer&lt;br/&gt;响应合成器\"]\n    S --&gt; A[\"最终回答\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from llama_index.core import VectorStoreIndex&#10;from llama_index.core.query_engine import RetrieverQueryEngine&#10;from llama_index.core.response_synthesizers import get_response_synthesizer&#10;&#10;index = VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents)&#10;retriever = index.as_retriever(similarity_top_k=10)&#10;&#10;synthesizer = get_response_synthesizer(&#10;    response_mode=&quot;tree_summarize&quot;,&#10;    use_async=True&#10;)&#10;&#10;query_engine = RetrieverQueryEngine(&#10;    retriever=retriever,&#10;    response_synthesizer=synthesizer&#10;)&#10;&#10;response = query_engine.query(&quot;系统的性能瓶颈在哪里？&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;回答: {response}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;引用来源: {[n.node.metadata for n in response.source_nodes]}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.core </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VectorStoreIndex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.core.query_engine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RetrieverQueryEngine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_index.core.response_synthesizers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_response_synthesizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">retriever </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index.as_retriever(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">similarity_top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">synthesizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_response_synthesizer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    response_mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tree_summarize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    use_async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query_engine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RetrieverQueryEngine(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    retriever</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">retriever,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    response_synthesizer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">synthesizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_engine.query(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"系统的性能瓶颈在哪里？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"回答: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"引用来源: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[n.node.metadata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.source_nodes]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>响应合成模式的选择会影响查询质量和延迟：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合成模式</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>Token 消耗</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>refine</td>\n<td>逐段精炼</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compact</td>\n<td>合并后精炼</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tree_summarize</td>\n<td>层级摘要</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>simple_summarize</td>\n<td>直接摘要</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"llamaindex-agent\">LlamaIndex Agent</h2><p>LlamaIndex 的 Agent 将查询引擎和工具结合，实现数据驱动的智能体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from llama_index.core.agent import ReActAgent&#10;from llama_index.core.tools import QueryEngineTool, FunctionTool&#10;&#10;project_tool = QueryEngineTool.from_defaults(&#10;    query_engine=project_query_engine,&#10;    name=&quot;project_docs&quot;,&#10;    description=&quot;搜索项目文档，获取架构设计、API 规范等信息&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;api_tool = QueryEngineTool.from_defaults(&#10;    query_engine=api_query_engine,&#10;    name=&quot;api_reference&quot;,&#10;    description=&quot;搜索 API 参考文档，获取接口定义和使用方法&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;def calculate_cost(tokens: int, model: str = &quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;) -&gt; str:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&q